@startuml state-request-dialog
title State — operation request dialog

[*] --> Form : open action\n(build envelope + context)
Form --> Raw : toggle (valid)
Raw --> Form : toggle (well-formed)
Form --> Invalid : required/type error
Raw --> Invalid : malformed XML
Invalid --> Form : fix (form)
Invalid --> Raw : fix (raw)
Form --> Submitting : Submit (valid)
Raw --> Submitting : Submit (valid)
Submitting --> ShowResult : HTTP 200
Submitting --> ShowFault : HTTP 500 soap:Fault
Submitting --> Error : network/timeout
ShowResult --> Form : new edit
ShowFault --> Form : edit (data preserved)
Error --> Form : retry (data preserved)
ShowResult --> [*] : close
ShowFault --> [*] : close

note right of Invalid
  Submission and raw->form toggle
  pass through one validity gate
  (FR-013, SC-007)
end note
@enduml
